        "content": "## Not activated — setup required\nApply the crm_* migration, configure Supabase CRM backend credential, and verify customer isolation first.\nSaves internal proposals/reminders/reports in Supabase crm_drafts. Does not email clients or publish AI output to the portal conversation.\nJobs remain in Supabase during Mac downtime. Failed runs are retried through expiring claims, maximum 3 attempts. Review crm_jobs failures in the owner dashboard.\nExisting mail workflow remains separate; SMTP acknowledgments and visitor analytics are not included in this worker."
